{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269lnvCG0wy91792989998.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產駿景園分行首席分區營業經理陳韻兒表示，近期整體租賃市場持續向好，大埔上然最新錄3期5座高層C8室，單位實用面積244平方呎，開放式間隔，開價約12,000元，日前議價後以10,800租出，平均實用呎租約44.3元。</p><p><br/>中原陳韻兒表示，新租客為內地生，見屋苑樓齡新，環境舒適，單位間隔合用，即決定租入單位自住。據了解，業主則於2026年1月以341萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享3.8厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:29:44.003542+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:20.501801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:27:17.636507+00:00","content_hash":"414e3c40b3e7e453fdabe89f0735b5d3fa8d6e539150adf4d33de659cd4ccd50","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:29:44.003542+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}